CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'args->args_proc_rsvmem.size <= 0'
#1829: FILE: drivers/staging/tidspbridge/pmgr/dspapi.c:1002:
+	if ((args->args_proc_rsvmem.size <= 0) ||
+	    (args->args_proc_rsvmem.size & (PG_SIZE4K - 1)) != 0)

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

